ONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3130978616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3142726901","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279#issuecomment-3142726901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279","id":3142726901,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc67UjT1","user":{"login":"JoeAu","id":3204858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu","html_url":"https://github.com/JoeAu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeAu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T06:23:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T06:24:55Z","body":"> 你好，ckg 是 code knowledge graph 的简写，该服务用于项目索引。Trae 为了实现更好的仓库理解能力，会基于代码仓库构建 Embedding 向量索引，应用于相关的 RAG 能力。之所以会产生网络流量，我理解是因为 Trae 同其他一些桌面端 AI Coding 软件一样，采取了本地+云端的混合索引架构。网络流量较多，因为还不了解你本地项目的情况，可能的猜测如本地项目体积较大，或者会更换不同的项目从而触发新的索引，或者使用 Trae 的频次较多，文件变更多重新索引也会多等。\n> \n> 构建RAG的过程会有一些流量传输，但是请放心，我们不会实际存储您的代码文件。我们的相关政策中有对应描述：\n> \n> * Privacy Policy (https://www.trae.ai/privacy-policy)\n> * Terms of Service (https://www.trae.ai/terms-of-service)\n\n这问题还没修复，呵呵，这是grok的分析报告\n\n```\n详细调查报告\n背景与问题描述\n用户报告在 Windows 系统上，ckg_server_windows_x64.exe 进程占用全部内存，并导致 C 盘硬盘疯狂读写，杀掉该进程后问题解决。用户同时提到使用 PyCharm 和 VSCode，这提示问题可能与这些开发环境中的某个插件或服务相关。\n通过分析，ckg_server_windows_x64.exe 似乎与 Clinical Knowledge Graph (CKG) 软件或 VSCode 的 marscode 插件有关。CKG 是一个用于构建实验数据和生物医学数据库的图数据库平台，而 marscode 插件则为 VSCode 提供代码补全和索引功能。问题的核心在于该进程的高资源占用，可能由大型文件夹索引或软件运行效率低下引起。\n详细分析\n1. 进程来源与相关性\n\n从网络搜索结果来看，ckg_server_windows_x64.exe 在 GitHub 的 Trae-AI/Trae 仓库中被报告为占用 100% CPU 和内存（见 https://github.com/Trae-AI/Trae/issues/360）。该问题描述为模板，尚未提供具体复现步骤，但明确指出该进程资源占用过高。\n另一个线索来自 CSDN 博客，讨论了 VSCode 上类似进程 ckg_server_linux_x64 的高 CPU 占用问题，原因指向 marscode 插件的自动补全功能，尤其在打开大型文件夹时（见博客内容，日期为 2025-03-24）。\nCKG 的官方文档（见 https://github.com/MannLabs/CKG）提到该软件需要大量磁盘空间（>= 80 GB），但未直接提及 Windows 上的高资源占用问题。\n\n2. 可能原因\n\nmarscode 插件：从 CSDN 博客可知，marscode 插件会搜索上下文并索引文件，特别是在大型项目中，可能会导致 ckg_server_windows_x64.exe 占用高 CPU 和内存，并触发硬盘频繁读写。这是当前最可能的罪魁祸首。\nCKG 软件本身：如果用户安装了 CKG，ckg_server_windows_x64.exe 可能是其服务进程，特别是在处理大型生物医学数据库时，资源占用可能过高。文档提到 CKG 需要服务器级别的资源，个人实例可能因硬件限制而表现不佳。\n系统资源限制：用户系统可能缺乏足够的 RAM 或磁盘空间，导致进程运行时触发高 I/O 操作。\n```\n\n这插件的bug，已经不是正常范围了，会有以下特征：\n1.  系统内存占用100%\n2. C盘读写IO使用率100%\n\n如果按楼主的观察，还有网络占用，如果没猜错的话，这插件会疯狂扫描C盘，大量写数据到C盘，大量分配内存，并传输数据到网络，这还叫正常行为？","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3142726901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4015507288","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279#issuecomment-4015507288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279","id":4015507288,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7vV8dY","user":{"login":"MilkCheese","id":76150868,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTUwODY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76150868?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese","html_url":"https://github.com/MilkCheese","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilkCheese/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T04:20:55Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T04:20:55Z","body":"服务器端也运行，真要命了。怎么在服务器端关掉字节的这些进程呢？","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4015507288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4016357507","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279#issuecomment-4016357507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1279","id":4016357507,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7vZMCD","user":{"login":"yujiangxian","id":83540285,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNTQwMjg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83540285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian","html_url":"https://github.com/yujiangxian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujiangxian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T12:21:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T12:21:07Z","body":"> 服务器端也运行，真要命了。怎么在服务器端关掉字节的这些进程呢？\n\n我已经放弃使用trae这个产品半年了，早期允许用Claude还能用用，在我发布这个issue之后我就放弃了，后来看见不允许trae使用Claude，更加不考虑了，现在我使用kiro，并且每个月给kiro付款US$20，反正我实在是不理解会把本地项目RAG到云端是什么操作，早期使用trae虽然卡，但是体验还不错，后来因为担忧安全问题，只能换了，很遗憾，字节的trae虽然不行，但是coze编程不错，虽然编码能力不好，但是优势在云端开发和部署一体，当然，免费才是最大的优势 哈哈哈","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4016357507/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}